{"schemaVersion":1,"shard":14,"count":37,"items":[{"key":"[\"B1L02-1-31\",\"幾點鐘\",\"幾點鐘\",\"几点钟\",\"Ph\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"現在幾點鐘？","pinyin":"Xiànzài jǐ diǎnzhōng?","english":"What time is it now?","sourceCardId":"B1L02-1-04","sourceFront":"現在","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2}],"wordHook":"幾(how many) + 點(point) + 鐘(clock) → how many points on the clock: 幾點鐘(what time)."},{"key":"[\"B1L06-2-02\",\"部\",\"部\",\"部\",\"M\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"我要買一部新電腦。","pinyin":"Wǒ yào mǎi yí bù xīn diànnǎo.","english":"I want to buy a new computer.","sourceCardId":"B1L06-2-09","sourceFront":"電腦","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":2},{"chinese":"我覺得這部電影很有趣，你覺得呢？","pinyin":"Wǒ juéde zhè bù diànyǐng hěn yǒuqù, nǐ juéde ne?","english":"I think this movie is very interesting. What do you think?","sourceCardId":"B1L06-2-05","sourceFront":"覺得","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":2},{"chinese":"聽說這部電影很有趣，我們晚一起去看，好不好？","pinyin":"Tīngshuō zhè bù diànyǐng hěn yǒuqù. Wǒmen wǎnshang yìqǐ qù kàn, hǎo bù hǎo?","english":"I heard that this movie is very interesting. How about we go to see it tonight?","sourceCardId":"B1L06-2-01","sourceFront":"電影","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":2}],"wordHook":"a 咅(to spit out) hits an 阝(place) and splits it into one 部(part)."},{"key":"[\"B1L06-2-04\",\"有趣\",\"有趣\",\"有趣\",\"Vs\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"王老師的課很有趣，每個學生都喜歡她。","pinyin":"Wáng lǎoshī de kè hěn yǒuqù, měi ge xuéshēng dōu xǐhuān tā.","english":"Teacher Wang’s class is very interesting; every student likes her.","sourceCardId":"B1L06-2-04","sourceFront":"有趣","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"我覺得這部電影很有趣，你覺得呢？","pinyin":"Wǒ juéde zhè bù diànyǐng hěn yǒuqù, nǐ juéde ne?","english":"I think this movie is very interesting. What do you think?","sourceCardId":"B1L06-2-05","sourceFront":"覺得","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":2},{"chinese":"聽說這部電影很有趣，我們晚一起去看，好不好？","pinyin":"Tīngshuō zhè bù diànyǐng hěn yǒuqù. Wǒmen wǎnshang yìqǐ qù kàn, hǎo bù hǎo?","english":"I heard that this movie is very interesting. How about we go to see it tonight?","sourceCardId":"B1L06-2-01","sourceFront":"電影","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":2},{"chinese":"我覺得有的舊東西很不錯，有的新東西也很有趣，我很喜歡看新車、新衣服，可是因為我的錢不多，所以我不常買。","pinyin":"Wǒ juéde yǒude jiù dōngxi hěn búcuò, yǒude xīn dōngxi yě hěn yǒuqù, wǒ hěn xǐhuān kàn xīn chē, xīn yīfu, kěshì yīnwèi wǒ de qián bù duō, suǒyǐ wǒ bù cháng mǎi.","english":"I think some old stuff is good and some new ones are interesting. I like to check the new car, new clothes out, but I do not have much money, so I don’t buy them often.","sourceCardId":"B1L08-3-01","sourceFront":"年輕","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":5},{"chinese":"真的啊？好有趣！","pinyin":"Zhēnde ā? Hǎo yǒuqù!","english":"Really? So interesting!","sourceCardId":"B1L15-1-01","sourceFront":"生肖","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"有趣 means interesting: 有(have) + 趣(interest) → having interest in something makes it interesting."},{"key":"[\"B1L07-1-17\",\"远\",\"遠\",\"远\",\"Vs\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"聽說那家飯店不遠，我想我們可以從學校走路去。","pinyin":"Tīngshuō nà jiā fàndiàn bù yuǎn, wǒ xiǎng wǒmen kěyǐ cóng xuéxiào zǒulù qù.","english":"I heard that the hotel is not far; I think we can go there from the school on foot.","sourceCardId":"B1L07-1-01","sourceFront":"怎麼","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"可是我覺得那裡有點兒遠，走路去太累了。","pinyin":"Kěshì wǒ juéde nàlǐ yǒudiǎnr yuǎn, zǒulù qù tài lèi le.","english":"But I think it’s a bit far. It’s too tiring to get there on foot.","sourceCardId":"B1L07-2-01","sourceFront":"路/馬路","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":3},{"chinese":"從我家到機場也不遠，開車去、坐捷運去都可以。","pinyin":"Cóng wǒ jiā dào jīchǎng yě bù yuǎn, kāichē qù, zuò jiéyùn qù dōu kěyǐ.","english":"It is not far from my house to the airport. I can go by car or MRT.","sourceCardId":"B1L07-3-01","sourceFront":"線","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":3}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B1L09-1-11\",\"書法\",\"書法\",\"书法\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"現在他在上書法課，我們四點去吧。","pinyin":"Xiànzài tā zài shàng shūfǎ kè, wǒmen sì diǎn qù ba.","english":"He is in the calligraphy class now. Let’s do it at 4 p.m.","sourceCardId":"B1L09-1-01","sourceFront":"句子","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2}],"wordHook":"書(book) + 法(method) → the method of writing characters, meaning calligraphy."},{"key":"[\"B1L14-2-01\",\"歡迎\",\"歡迎\",\"欢迎\",\"Vst\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"大家都歡迎新老師到我們學校來。","pinyin":"Dàjiā dōu huānyíng xīn lǎoshī dào wǒmen xuéxiào lái.","english":"Everyone welcomes the new teacher to come to our school.","sourceCardId":"B1L14-2-01","sourceFront":"歡迎","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"歡迎你們到我家來，請進。","pinyin":"Huānyíng nǐmen dào wǒ jiā lái, qǐng jìn.","english":"Welcome to my home, please come in.","sourceCardId":"B1L14-2-02","sourceFront":"進","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":2},{"chinese":"我同事說那家店的麵包很好吃，大人、小孩都喜歡，很受歡迎。","pinyin":"Wǒ tóngshì shuō nà jiā diàn de miànbāo hěn hǎochī, dàrén, xiǎohái dōu xǐhuān, hěn shòu huānyíng.","english":"My colleague says that bakery's bread is very delicious; both adults and children like it—it's very popular.","sourceCardId":"B1L15-3-16","sourceFront":"受歡迎","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":5},{"chinese":"週末我都在家，隨時歡迎你來玩。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L06-2-02","sourceFront":"隨時","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"像珍珠奶茶那樣的飲料，在日本也很受歡迎。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L08-1-14","sourceFront":"那樣","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這首歌很受歡迎，被認為是今年的最佳歌曲。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L03-2-19","sourceFront":"最佳","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"王老闆舉辦了一個免費吃鬆餅的活動，目的是調查哪種口味的鬆餅最受歡迎。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L06-1-10","sourceFront":"調查","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"A:「快時尚」的服裝只有剛出來的頭幾個月受歡迎。 B:哦？你的意思是「快時尚」的衣服很快就失去魅力了嗎？","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L09-1-04","sourceFront":"哦","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這部戲的男主角英俊、女主角漂亮，加上演員都演得很好，所以非常受歡迎。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L10-2-11","sourceFront":"主角","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"A:您好，歡迎您來面試。請問貴姓？ B:您好，我姓童，很高興今天能到貴公司來面試。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L12-1-03","sourceFront":"貴","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這次亞洲文化展，除了樂器表演，還有傳統服裝試穿活動，歡迎各位來參觀。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L12-2-01","sourceFront":"各位","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"顏教授對漢語語法有很深入的研究，難怪他的語法課那麼受歡迎。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L14-2-19","sourceFront":"深入","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"每年大學迎新時，學校總是會辦舞會歡迎大家。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L04-1-11","sourceFront":"迎新","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"一家餐廳要是受歡迎，就算把店關在郊區的某個小巷子裡，也還是時常客滿。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L05-1-05","sourceFront":"巷子","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"別看超人那麼受歡迎就羨慕他，其實能力越強，身上的責任也越重。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L13-1-23","sourceFront":"超人","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"那位模特兒曾多次參與連續劇演出，相當受歡迎。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L14-1-44","sourceFront":"參與","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"如果您對學校課程有任何問題，歡迎至辦公室談談。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L15-2-32","sourceFront":"至","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"歡(happy) + 迎(welcome) → a happy welcome."},{"key":"[\"B2L09-2-19\",\"感动\",\"感動\",\"感动\",\"Vs\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"黃小姐生日那天，男朋友送給她九百九十九朵玫瑰花，讓她感動得不得了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L09-2-19","sourceFront":"感動","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"我很餓，同事把他的薯條分一半給我，讓我好感動。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L14-2-13","sourceFront":"分","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"那場強烈地震發生以後，許多國家的專業人員都來救災，讓人非常感動。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L05-2-22","sourceFront":"救災","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"九二一大地震時，臺灣人發揮了互相幫助的精神，讓人非常感動。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L05-2-33","sourceFront":"發揮","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"大地震過後才幾天，這個災區的民眾除了收到許多衣服和食物，還收到五千萬元，讓大家又驚訝又感動。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L06-1-15","sourceFront":"驚訝","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這部電影是用真實故事拍成的，讓觀眾感覺很真實，也很感動。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L11-1-30","sourceFront":"真實","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我男朋友親手做了一張卡片，還買了一個漂亮的背包送給我， 他的心意讓我很感動。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L14-2-05","sourceFront":"心意","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"當鄰居生活遇到困難時，老馬總是主動提供協助，真令人感動。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L16-2-04","sourceFront":"令","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"生日時，老婆親手織了一頂帽子送我，讓我好感動。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L07-2-16","sourceFront":"頂","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B2L10-1-23\",\"体重\",\"體重\",\"体重\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"我最近每天運動，體重減了兩公斤。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L10-1-24","sourceFront":"減","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"我買了一個機器，不但能幫我量體重，還能量身高。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L10-1-47","sourceFront":"量","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"如果你亂吃垃圾食品，就算按時運動，體重也很難減輕。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L10-2-17","sourceFront":"按時","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我吃得少，每天早上也運動，但是我的體重仍然超重。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L14-1-08","sourceFront":"超重","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"妳身高一百七十公分，體重六十公斤，還不到減肥的程度。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L15-1-08","sourceFront":"不到","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B2L10-1-38\",\"开水\",\"開水\",\"开水\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"運動以後最好喝開水，不要喝太甜的飲料。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L10-1-38","sourceFront":"開水","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B2L11-1-11\",\"感兴趣\",\"感興趣\",\"感兴趣\",\"Vs\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"我對這支新手機很感興趣，你能給我介紹介紹嗎？","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L11-1-11","sourceFront":"感興趣","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"店員把這台咖啡機的特色說明得非常清楚，聽了他的說明以後，大家都很感興趣。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L01-2-13","sourceFront":"說明","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"透過社群網站，我們可以加入感興趣的社團，讓自己的生活更充實。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L11-1-35","sourceFront":"社群網站","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"那位畫家的作品，很多國內外的買家都十分感興趣。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L03-2-20","sourceFront":"買家","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"路教授最近發表的這套跟人體大腦有關的理論，令其他科學家很感興趣。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L08-1-45","sourceFront":"套","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這對夫婦打扮得相當講究，讓我對他們從事的行業很感興趣。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L12-1-07","sourceFront":"行業","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B2L11-1-28\",\"談戀愛\",\"談戀愛\",\"谈恋爱\",\"V-sep\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"佳佳認為談戀愛的對象，年齡不重要，容不容易溝通、個性適不適合才是最重要的。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L10-1-24","sourceFront":"年齡","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"談戀愛時不能太花心，(也)就是說不能見一個就愛一個。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L04-1-46","sourceFront":"就是說","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B2L15-1-05\",\"吵架\",\"吵架\",\"吵架\",\"V-sep\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"王先生跟女朋友吵了一架，現在兩個人不說話了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L15-1-05","sourceFront":"吵架","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"小朋友！別吵架、別打架了，有話好好地說。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L15-1-09","sourceFront":"打架","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"小朋友！別吵架、別打架了，有話好好地說。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L15-1-10","sourceFront":"小朋友","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"我昨天親眼看到小史跟人吵架，才知道他罵人的樣子好可怕喔！","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L05-2-18","sourceFront":"親眼","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"小連跟老闆吵架而離開了公司，為了讓家人能繼續過安定的生活，他正努力地找新工作。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L10-2-05","sourceFront":"安定","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"有些事忍耐一下就過去了，什麼都想以吵架的方式解決，遲早會出事的。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L10-1-14","sourceFront":"出事","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我和姊姊小時候常為了搶玩具吵個沒完，有時候還打架呢","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L05-1-41","sourceFront":"搶","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"張先生夫婦自從結婚以來，不曾吵過架，因為兩人的脾氣都太好了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L15-1-17","sourceFront":"以來","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"前幾天他們因為一點兒小誤會吵了一架，還好現在和好了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L01-2-13","sourceFront":"和好","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B2L16-1-14\",\"吹\",\"吹\",\"吹\",\"V\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"夏天的晚上，我喜歡去公園散散步、吹吹風。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L16-1-14","sourceFront":"吹","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"他吹笛子吹得很好，辦過幾場很成功的音樂表演。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L16-1-15","sourceFront":"笛子","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"這個地區被颱風破壞得相當嚴重，不是樹木倒了，就是屋頂被吹走了，情況非常糟糕。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L05-1-24","sourceFront":"糟糕","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"夏天的夜晚，人們喜歡在屋子外面吹著風、喝著茶，聊聊有趣的事。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L05-2-12","sourceFront":"夜晚","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"爺爺很喜歡在海邊釣魚，看著風景、吹著海風，他覺得舒服極了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L06-2-22","sourceFront":"釣","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"夏天的夜晚，在院子裡吹著涼快的風，欣賞天空美麗的星星， 簡直就像在天堂一樣。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L15-1-12","sourceFront":"簡直","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"上週末我們去爬山，走到半路時忽然吹起大風來，害我們不得不下山。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L01-1-26","sourceFront":"半路","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"冷氣機裡的網子要常拆下來洗，不然可能吹出髒空氣。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L03-1-51","sourceFront":"拆","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"颱風過後，很多電線被強風吹壞了，需要幾天才能恢復正常。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L05-2-10","sourceFront":"電線","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"那家商店的廣告牌子被一陣強風吹起後，還差一點打到路上的摩托車，真可怕。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L06-2-16","sourceFront":"陣","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B3L01-1-30\",\"挑战\",\"挑戰\",\"挑战\",\"V/N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"這家餐廳最辣的牛肉麵， 小程挑戰過好幾次，可惜都沒吃完","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L01-1-30","sourceFront":"挑戰","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"寫劇本對我來說是個很大的挑戰，但是也能得到不少收穫，所以我願意試試。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L01-1-30","sourceFront":"挑戰","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"大偉挺喜歡他現在的工作，不但能挑戰自己，也能學習新的東西。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L02-1-04","sourceFront":"挺","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"舅舅對我很好，不管我遇到什麼挑戰，只要跟他說一聲，他一定會幫忙。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L02-2-18","sourceFront":"聲","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"每個人都有夢想，只要不怕挑戰、堅持到底，就能夢想成真。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L10-2-08","sourceFront":"到底","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"他願意挑戰自己的工作能力，並積極地克服挫折，真是難得。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L04-1-04","sourceFront":"難得","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"對自己的事業很熱情的人，就不怕挑戰任何困難。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L06-1-34","sourceFront":"熱情","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"當你面臨困難或挑戰時，也正是表現個人智慧與能力的最佳時刻。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L09-1-17","sourceFront":"面臨","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"只有勇敢面對挑戰、克服困難的人，才能深深體會到成就感帶來的快樂。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L15-2-18","sourceFront":"成就感","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"樂觀的人會積極挑戰困難，就算無法成功也不會感到失望。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L16-1-24","sourceFront":"感到","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"ra