nglish":"","sourceCardId":"B4L15-2-03","sourceFront":"古典","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"現代人生活忙碌，就算是好友也偶然才碰面聊聊。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L15-2-24","sourceFront":"偶然","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B3L12-1-26\",\"不論\",\"不論\",\"不论\",\"Conj\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"商先生從不發脾氣，人也很謙虛，不論別人怎麼批評他，他還是很客氣地說謝謝。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L12-1-26","sourceFront":"不論","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"不論是工業或家庭廢水，對人們的健康都有不好的影響。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L05-1-44","sourceFront":"廢水","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"他一直熱愛翻譯工作，不論多困難都會想辦法克服。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L07-2-18","sourceFront":"熱愛","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"阿溫對花草很有興趣，不論生長在平原或山地的，他都叫得出名字來。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L08-1-27","sourceFront":"花草","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"喜劇中的男女主角，不論相處過程中碰到多少挫折，結局總是快樂又幸福的。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L08-2-06","sourceFront":"喜劇","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"父母要求孩子不論在任何情況都不許騙人。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L10-2-16","sourceFront":"不許","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我們全家都是信基督教的，不論教會舉辦什麼活動，我們都一定去參加。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L11-1-12","sourceFront":"教會","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"Clearly 不(not) possessing 論(debate): 不論 means no matter what, who, how."},{"key":"[\"B3L16-1-01\",\"面条\",\"麵條\",\"面条\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"哥哥去超市買了一袋玉米和兩包麵條，要為家人準備晚餐。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L16-1-03","sourceFront":"玉米","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"小孩子剛學習用筷子吃麵條時，常需要媽媽先替他把麵拌一拌。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L14-1-30","sourceFront":"拌","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B3L16-1-15\",\"領域\",\"領域\",\"领域\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"上帝是不是存在，這是屬於宗教領域的問題，科學家的解釋不一定是正確的。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L16-1-15","sourceFront":"領域","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"要是你對文藝領域不了解，最好不要隨便批評別人的作品。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L06-2-01","sourceFront":"文藝","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這次座談會邀請了各領域的人們，主要目的是對國內的地方建設提一些建議。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L09-1-38","sourceFront":"座談會","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"她的專業是人工智慧，這個領域的問題可以請教她。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L13-2-17","sourceFront":"人工智慧","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"Combining 領(withdraw money) and 域(area): 領域 means field."},{"key":"[\"B3L16-1-22\",\"證明\",\"證明\",\"证明\",\"V\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"科學家早就證明了氣溫的變化對農業生產有不好的影響，可是到目前還找不到解決的好辦法。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L16-1-22","sourceFront":"證明","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"連警察都證明這個車禍是段老闆喝醉造成的，可是他仍然不肯承認。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L16-2-08","sourceFront":"仍然","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":3},{"chinese":"身分證是用來證明一個人的身分時使用的。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L02-1-21","sourceFront":"身分證","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"華語中心的學生想在臺灣的銀行開戶，得先準備在學證明。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L02-2-17","sourceFront":"證明","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"Combining 證(prove) and 明(bright): 證明 means prove."},{"key":"[\"B4L07-1-41\",\"梦想\",\"夢想\",\"梦想\",\"V\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"我夢想有一天可以到世界各地旅行。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L07-1-41","sourceFront":"夢想","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"每天光說夢想，一點兒用都沒有，還是努力實現比較實在。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L07-1-42","sourceFront":"實現","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"他的夢想是利用水來當作交通工具的燃料，可是很多人認為不可能。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L05-1-53","sourceFront":"燃料","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"我心中有兩個夢想，一是當歌星，另一個是去各國旅行。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L01-2-05","sourceFront":"另","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"小年的夢想就是蓋一棟土地面積六十坪、三層樓高的房子，讓全家人都住在一起。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L16-1-08","sourceFront":"面積","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"易先生對戲劇有很大的興趣，小時候的夢想就是當一名成功的演員。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L14-2-16","sourceFront":"戲劇","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"每個人都有夢想，只要不怕挑戰、堅持到底，就能夢想成真。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L10-2-08","sourceFront":"到底","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"林小姐從小就希望有一家屬於自己的麵包店，今年終於夢想成真了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L08-1-16","sourceFront":"屬於","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"小在追求夢想的路上，別太在意別人說什麼，只要不斷地努力，就能夢想成真。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L07-1-31","sourceFront":"在意","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"不管追求夢想的路上有多辛苦，都是我們一輩子珍貴的回憶。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L04-2-13","sourceFront":"回憶","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"我一直想到歐洲去旅行，只是現在忙得沒時間去，希望明年能夢想成真。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L04-1-33","sourceFront":"只是","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"章先生一直想當律師，經過多年的努力，終於夢想成真了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L04-1-23","sourceFront":"終於","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"小韓早晚都打工，是因為想多存一些錢，早一點完成出國念書的夢想。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L02-1-09","sourceFront":"早晚","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"A:我希望將來能當一名很棒的導演。 B:我相信只要你不斷地努力，就能夢想成真的！","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L01-2-22","sourceFront":"夢想成真","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"在追求夢想的路上，會遇到很困難的事情，只有不斷努力，才能完成夢想。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L01-2-01","sourceFront":"追求","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"有人說，有夢最美。應該趁著年輕勇敢地做夢，更要努力讓夢想變成真的。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L01-1-18","sourceFront":"做夢","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"美美最大的夢想是，將來能有一棟又漂亮又舒服的大房子。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L01-1-01","sourceFront":"夢想","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"A:你說自己沒有想做的事，難道你沒有夢想嗎？ B:我只想簡單過生活，再說，沒有夢想難道不行嗎？","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L08-1-48","sourceFront":"難道","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我愛看漫畫，在漫畫裡可以看見許多人們還沒實現的夢想。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L08-2-05","sourceFront":"漫畫","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"擁有一架小飛機並親自在天空上駕駛，一直是孫小姐的夢想。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L12-1-15","sourceFront":"駕駛","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"雖然受到了重大的挫折，可是他並沒有放棄自己的夢想。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L15-1-23","sourceFront":"並","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L08-1-27\",\"花草\",\"花草\",\"花草\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"阿溫對花草很有興趣，不論生長在平原或山地的，他都叫得出名字來。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L08-1-27","sourceFront":"花草","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"今天光是整理前院的花草樹木就讓我累得要命，只好明天再整理後院了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L10-1-44","sourceFront":"要命","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"A:你要不要跟我一起去茶館喝杯茶？ B:與其去喝茶，我倒想去外面走走，看看花草樹木。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L13-1-46","sourceFront":"與其","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L09-2-05\",\"成為\",\"成為\",\"成为\",\"Vpt\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"要想成為成功的上班族，一切就得照規矩來。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L09-2-05","sourceFront":"成為","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"這家醫院的內科有最新設備，因此成為許多病人的第一選擇。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L10-1-18","sourceFront":"內科","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"他想成為網路作家，不過擔心將來的收入可能不穩定。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L12-2-19","sourceFront":"作家","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L12-1-34\",\"哪怕\",\"哪怕\",\"哪怕\",\"Conj\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"他對志工服務一向有興趣，哪怕做得又忙又累，他也願意。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L12-1-34","sourceFront":"哪怕","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"父母反對她從事電影行業，哪怕收入很高，還是不贊成。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L13-2-14","sourceFront":"反對","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L13-2-16\",\"疑問\",\"疑問\",\"疑问\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"老師提醒學生有疑問要馬上解決，免得越到後面越不了解。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L13-2-16","sourceFront":"疑問","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L14-2-04\",\"傳說\",\"傳說\",\"传说\",\"N/V\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"傳說月亮上住著一隻兔子，這個神話留給孩子們許多想像空間。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L14-2-04","sourceFront":"傳說","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"那棟沒有主人的房屋充滿恐怖的傳說，一般人都不願意靠近。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L15-2-31","sourceFront":"恐怖","sourceBoo